title: "StudyBalance AI: Explainable Academic Workload Forecasting and Preventive Planning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "da Silva"
    given-names: "Geazi Junior Buceli"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  StudyBalance AI is a local-first educational prototype for seven-day academic
  workload forecasting. It combines a task planner, a softmax classifier trained
  on deterministic synthetic data, local counterfactual explanations,
  deterministic recommendations, and what-if simulation. It is not a diagnostic
  or clinical system.
keywords:
